<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 7.07 bln in 3.0 pct repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 7.07 bln in 3.0 pct repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Friday said it had allotted 7.07 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The bank said it filled seven percent of bids.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 11.12 billion schillings, or 12 percent of bids, also at a fixed 3.0 percent. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
